{"diagnosis": "mem_la_addr low bits are stuck at 2'b10 instead of 2'b00, so every lookahead fetch/data address is misaligned. Trace shows TRAP: fetch misalign addr low bits nonzero with tohost FAIL 0xdead. Root cause is line 382 forcing {..,2'b10} on both fetch and data paths instead of word-aligned {..,2'b00}.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -380,3 +380,3 @@
 	assign mem_la_read = resetn && ((!mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word && !mem_state && (mem_do_rinst || mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rdata)) ||
 			(COMPRESSED_ISA && mem_xfer && (!last_mem_valid ? mem_la_firstword : mem_la_firstword_reg) && !mem_la_secondword && &mem_rdata_latched[1:0]));
-	assign mem_la_addr = (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst) ? {next_pc[31:2] + mem_la_firstword_xfer, 2'b10} : {reg_op1[31:2], 2'b10};
+	assign mem_la_addr = (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst) ? {next_pc[31:2] + mem_la_firstword_xfer, 2'b00} : {reg_op1[31:2], 2'b00};
", "expected": "tohost PASS with no fetch misalign TRAP on tb_picorv32_fetch seed 42"}

